{"video": "cebola", "titulo": "Por que a cebola faz chorar?", "fps": 30, "durationInFrames": 1800, "durationSeconds": 60.0, "engine": "elevenlabs", "voz": {"estilo": "documentario", "ritmo": 1.0}, "scenes": [{"id": "gancho", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 0, "endFrame": 75, "lines": [{"text": "Por que a cebola faz a gente chorar?", "startFrame": 3, "endFrame": 64, "words": [{"text": "Por", "startFrame": 7, "endFrame": 8}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 10, "endFrame": 11}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 12, "endFrame": 13}, {"text": "cebola", "startFrame": 16, "endFrame": 30}, {"text": "faz", "startFrame": 35, "endFrame": 40}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 41, "endFrame": 42}, {"text": "gente", "startFrame": 43, "endFrame": 49}, {"text": "chorar?", "startFrame": 52, "endFrame": 64}]}]}, {"id": "armadilha", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 75, "endFrame": 415, "lines": [{"text": "Ela não te faz chorar porque toca sertanejo… e sim porque esconde uma armadilha química!", "startFrame": 87, "endFrame": 262, "words": [{"text": "Ela", "startFrame": 105, "endFrame": 110}, {"text": "não", "startFrame": 112, "endFrame": 115}, {"text": "te", "startFrame": 117, "endFrame": 119}, {"text": "faz", "startFrame": 122, "endFrame": 127}, {"text": "chorar", "startFrame": 129, "endFrame": 136}, {"text": "porque", "startFrame": 139, "endFrame": 146}, {"text": "toca", "startFrame": 148, "endFrame": 155}, {"text": "sertanejo…", "startFrame": 158, "endFrame": 184}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 185, "endFrame": 187}, {"text": "sim", "startFrame": 191, "endFrame": 196}, {"text": "porque", "startFrame": 199, "endFrame": 206}, {"text": "esconde", "startFrame": 208, "endFrame": 220}, {"text": "uma", "startFrame": 223, "endFrame": 225}, {"text": "armadilha", "startFrame": 227, "endFrame": 242}, {"text": "química!", "startFrame": 247, "endFrame": 262}]}, {"text": "Inteira, ela guarda os ingredientes separadinhos, cada um no seu cantinho.", "startFrame": 274, "endFrame": 404, "words": [{"text": "Inteira,", "startFrame": 274, "endFrame": 293}, {"text": "ela", "startFrame": 296, "endFrame": 300}, {"text": "guarda", "startFrame": 304, "endFrame": 310}, {"text": "os", "startFrame": 311, "endFrame": 312}, {"text": "ingredientes", "startFrame": 314, "endFrame": 334}, {"text": "separadinhos,", "startFrame": 336, "endFrame": 362}, {"text": "cada", "startFrame": 364, "endFrame": 372}, {"text": "um", "startFrame": 374, "endFrame": 377}, {"text": "no", "startFrame": 378, "endFrame": 379}, {"text": "seu", "startFrame": 382, "endFrame": 386}, {"text": "cantinho.", "startFrame": 390, "endFrame": 404}]}]}, {"id": "corte", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 415, "endFrame": 566, "lines": [{"text": "Mas quando a faca corta, as células se rompem… e tudo se mistura!", "startFrame": 427, "endFrame": 554, "words": [{"text": "Mas", "startFrame": 427, "endFrame": 434}, {"text": "quando", "startFrame": 435, "endFrame": 441}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 443, "endFrame": 444}, {"text": "faca", "startFrame": 446, "endFrame": 453}, {"text": "corta,", "startFrame": 456, "endFrame": 470}, {"text": "as", "startFrame": 474, "endFrame": 477}, {"text": "células", "startFrame": 479, "endFrame": 489}, {"text": "se", "startFrame": 492, "endFrame": 494}, {"text": "rompem…", "startFrame": 498, "endFrame": 511}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 513, "endFrame": 514}, {"text": "tudo", "startFrame": 521, "endFrame": 528}, {"text": "se", "startFrame": 530, "endFrame": 533}, {"text": "mistura!", "startFrame": 537, "endFrame": 554}]}]}, {"id": "gas", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 566, "endFrame": 760, "lines": [{"text": "Uma enzima transforma essa mistura num gás invisível…", "startFrame": 577, "endFrame": 670, "words": [{"text": "Uma", "startFrame": 577, "endFrame": 582}, {"text": "enzima", "startFrame": 587, "endFrame": 596}, {"text": "transforma", "startFrame": 599, "endFrame": 616}, {"text": "essa", "startFrame": 618, "endFrame": 620}, {"text": "mistura", "startFrame": 624, "endFrame": 632}, {"text": "num", "startFrame": 635, "endFrame": 640}, {"text": "gás", "startFrame": 641, "endFrame": 647}, {"text": "invisível…", "startFrame": 649, "endFrame": 670}]}, {"text": "que voa direto pros seus olhos!", "startFrame": 682, "endFrame": 749, "words": [{"text": "que", "startFrame": 682, "endFrame": 686}, {"text": "voa", "startFrame": 689, "endFrame": 698}, {"text": "direto", "startFrame": 703, "endFrame": 713}, {"text": "pros", "startFrame": 714, "endFrame": 718}, {"text": "seus", "startFrame": 719, "endFrame": 725}, {"text": "olhos!", "startFrame": 727, "endFrame": 749}]}]}, {"id": "olho", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 760, "endFrame": 936, "lines": [{"text": "O gás irrita os nervos do olho, e o corpo reage: solta lágrimas pra lavar tudo!", "startFrame": 772, "endFrame": 924, "words": [{"text": "O", "startFrame": 772, "endFrame": 774}, {"text": "gás", "startFrame": 777, "endFrame": 786}, {"text": "irrita", "startFrame": 789, "endFrame": 798}, {"text": "os", "startFrame": 801, "endFrame": 803}, {"text": "nervos", "startFrame": 805, "endFrame": 815}, {"text": "do", "startFrame": 817, "endFrame": 820}, {"text": "olho,", "startFrame": 822, "endFrame": 835}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 837, "endFrame": 838}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 840, "endFrame": 841}, {"text": "corpo", "startFrame": 845, "endFrame": 851}, {"text": "reage:", "startFrame": 853, "endFrame": 871}, {"text": "solta", "startFrame": 873, "endFrame": 882}, {"text": "lágrimas", "startFrame": 885, "endFrame": 897}, {"text": "pra", "startFrame": 899, "endFrame": 901}, {"text": "lavar", "startFrame": 903, "endFrame": 913}, {"text": "tudo!", "startFrame": 915, "endFrame": 924}]}]}, {"id": "descoberta", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 936, "endFrame": 1286, "lines": [{"text": "Essa enzima só foi descoberta em 2002, por cientistas japoneses.", "startFrame": 947, "endFrame": 1072, "words": [{"text": "Essa", "startFrame": 947, "endFrame": 959}, {"text": "enzima", "startFrame": 959, "endFrame": 974}, {"text": "só", "startFrame": 974, "endFrame": 979}, {"text": "foi", "startFrame": 979, "endFrame": 987}, {"text": "descoberta", "startFrame": 987, "endFrame": 1013}, {"text": "em", "startFrame": 1013, "endFrame": 1019}, {"text": "2002,", "startFrame": 1019, "endFrame": 1023}, {"text": "por", "startFrame": 1027, "endFrame": 1031}, {"text": "cientistas", "startFrame": 1031, "endFrame": 1050}, {"text": "japoneses.", "startFrame": 1050, "endFrame": 1072}]}, {"text": "E a descoberta ganhou até o IgNobel, o prêmio das pesquisas que fazem rir e depois pensar!", "startFrame": 1083, "endFrame": 1275, "words": [{"text": "E", "startFrame": 1083, "endFrame": 1089}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 1089, "endFrame": 1094}, {"text": "descoberta", "startFrame": 1094, "endFrame": 1119}, {"text": "ganhou", "startFrame": 1119, "endFrame": 1130}, {"text": "até", "startFrame": 1130, "endFrame": 1141}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 1141, "endFrame": 1147}, {"text": "IgNobel,", "startFrame": 1147, "endFrame": 1166}, {"text": "o", "startFrame": 1168, "endFrame": 1173}, {"text": "prêmio", "startFrame": 1173, "endFrame": 1187}, {"text": "das", "startFrame": 1187, "endFrame": 1193}, {"text": "pesquisas", "startFrame": 1193, "endFrame": 1214}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 1214, "endFrame": 1220}, {"text": "fazem", "startFrame": 1220, "endFrame": 1232}, {"text": "rir", "startFrame": 1242, "endFrame": 1250}, {"text": "e", "startFrame": 1250, "endFrame": 1252}, {"text": "depois", "startFrame": 1252, "endFrame": 1263}, {"text": "pensar!", "startFrame": 1263, "endFrame": 1275}]}]}, {"id": "dicas", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 1286, "endFrame": 1516, "lines": [{"text": "Quer chorar menos? Use faca bem afiada, que estraga menos células.", "startFrame": 1298, "endFrame": 1421, "words": [{"text": "Quer", "startFrame": 1299, "endFrame": 1302}, {"text": "chorar", "startFrame": 1304, "endFrame": 1311}, {"text": "menos?", "startFrame": 1314, "endFrame": 1331}, {"text": "Use", "startFrame": 1334, "endFrame": 1338}, {"text": "faca", "startFrame": 1340, "endFrame": 1352}, {"text": "bem", "startFrame": 1355, "endFrame": 1359}, {"text": "afiada,", "startFrame": 1364, "endFrame": 1379}, {"text": "que", "startFrame": 1380, "endFrame": 1381}, {"text": "estraga", "startFrame": 1385, "endFrame": 1395}, {"text": "menos", "startFrame": 1398, "endFrame": 1403}, {"text": "células.", "startFrame": 1405, "endFrame": 1421}]}, {"text": "E deixe a cebola na geladeira antes de cortar.", "startFrame": 1432, "endFrame": 1505, "words": [{"text": "E", "startFrame": 1432, "endFrame": 1434}, {"text": "deixe", "startFrame": 1437, "endFrame": 1442}, {"text": "a", "startFrame": 1443, "endFrame": 1444}, {"text": "cebola", "startFrame": 1446, "endFrame": 1456}, {"text": "na", "startFrame": 1458, "endFrame": 1461}, {"text": "geladeira", "startFrame": 1462, "endFrame": 1478}, {"text": "antes", "startFrame": 1481, "endFrame": 1485}, {"text": "de", "startFrame": 1487, "endFrame": 1490}, {"text": "cortar.", "startFrame": 1492, "endFrame": 1505}]}]}, {"id": "conclusao", "capitulo": "", "startFrame": 1516, "endFrame": 1800, "lines": [{"text": "Resumindo: não é sofrência… é química pura!", "startFrame": 1528, "endFrame": 1628, "words": [{"text": "Resumindo:", "startFrame": 1528, "endFrame": 1549}, {"text": "não", "startFrame": 1550, "endFrame": 1556}, {"text": "é", "startFrame": 1559, "endFrame": 1561}, {"text": "sofrência…", "startFrame": 1564, "endFrame": 1586}, {"text": "é", "startFrame": 1588, "endFrame": 1592}, {"text": "química", "startFrame": 1595, "endFrame": 1609}, {"text": "pura!", "startFrame": 1612, "endFrame": 1628}]}, {"text": "E aí, qual comida te faz chorar? Conta aí!", "startFrame": 1640, "endFrame": 1746, "words": [{"text": "E", "startFrame": 1661, "endFrame": 1664}, {"text": "aí,", "startFrame": 1666, "endFrame": 1678}, {"text": "qual", "startFrame": 1682, "endFrame": 1685}, {"text": "comida", "startFrame": 1688, "endFrame": 1695}, {"text": "te", "startFrame": 1697, "endFrame": 1700}, {"text": "faz", "startFrame": 1702, "endFram